// What waits in the outer reach (GDR-0099 A5-A7, GDR-0103): the Grown's groves, wary (they wake only when provoked:
// a shot, a ram, a scan close by or a stripped wreck, GDR-0102), so `wake_radius` matters only for a scan; the
// rim's stragglers near the border; the outer gates' precursor guardian; and the elders, the Grown's giants, at
// sites of their own. A grove's own dead lie among its living: strip them and the grove wakes. PLACEHOLDER
// NUMBERS (lead defaults, 18 Oct 2026; counts tuned with the headless voyage runner,
// docs/results/outer-balance-2026-10-18.md).
[
    (
        id: "grove_pair",
        name: "Thorn pair",
        summary: "A rammer and a thornback drifting together, calm until something provokes them.",
        tags: ["grown"],
        ships: [
            (ship: "grown_rammer", count: (1, 1)),
            (ship: "grown_thornback", count: (1, 1)),
