        summary: "A gate to the middle band, the precursor guardian that keeps it, and a gunner and a hunter at its side.",
        description: "Shoot the [[ship:automaton_bastion]] apart and its fists fight on alone; the heart holds until both its cores go dark. Beaten, its gate opens.",
